  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\n- {貯金|ちょきん}する (to save money)\n- {貯金|ちょきん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{下|お}ろす→下ろす：02029_orosu⟧ (to withdraw savings)\n- {貯金|ちょきん}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦ある→ある：00006_aru⟧/⟦ない→ない：01118_nai⟧ (to have/not have savings)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{貯金|ちょきん}{箱|ばこ}→貯金箱：15345_chokinbako⟧ (piggy bank, savings box)\n- ⟦{定期|ていき}→定期：03538_teiki⟧{貯金|ちょきん} (fixed-term deposit)\n- ⟦{普通|ふつう}→普通：01502_futsuu⟧{貯金|ちょきん} (regular savings account)\n- ⟦{郵便|ゆうびん}→郵便：03803_yuubin⟧{貯金|ちょきん} (postal savings)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {貯金|ちょきん}: Savings, deposits (general term, often postal savings)\n- ⟦{預金|よきん}→預金：05420_yokin⟧: Bank deposit (specifically at banks)\n- ⟦{貯蓄|ちょちく}→貯蓄：18972_chochiku⟧: Savings (broader, includes investments)",
